ILDA8CH buffered receiver, VDIFF 0 V, common-mode 2.5 V
VP dp 0 DC 2.5 AC 1
VN dn 0 DC 2.5 AC 1
RSIP dp dsp 12.5
CSIP dsp 0 50p
RIP dsp ip 100k
RPIP ip 0 10Meg
RSIN dn dsn 12.5
CSIN dsn 0 50p
RIN dsn inn 100k
RPIN inn 0 10Meg
CIP ip 0 8.5p
CIN inn 0 8.5p
X1 ip bp bp AMP
X2 inn bn bn AMP
RFP bp fp 1k
RFN bn fn 1k
CFP fp 0 4.7n
CFN fn 0 4.7n
R1 fp sp 20k
R2 sp 0 20000
R3 fn sn 20k
R4 drv sn 20000
X3 sp sn drv AMP
